mai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/607324ebd113883b783027bf664b800e897678c7/ss_607324ebd113883b783027bf664b800e897678c7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768309447","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/607324ebd113883b783027bf664b800e897678c7/ss_607324ebd113883b783027bf664b800e897678c7.600x338.jpg?t=1768309447"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/76e1b5757e4c263235470e465370bd66643f2205/ss_76e1b5757e4c263235470e465370bd66643f2205.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768309447","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447740/76e1b5757e4c263235470e465370bd66643f2205/ss_76e1b5757e4c263235470e465370bd66643f2205.600x338.jpg?t=1768309447"}],"short_description":"The \u201cDomain\u201d exists as a mass of cold concrete, twisted monsters, and chaotic anomalies. You are an \u201cAgent\u201d sent to ensure it does not reach \u201cTerminal Mass\u201d. Complete missions. Upgrade your weaponry. Access deeper and darker sectors of the Domain. Will you defeat the horrors that lie at its core?","steam_appid":3447740,"support_info":{"email":"jinice99@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}